<title>BELGIUM: BBL CUTS MORTGAGE RATES.</title>
<headline>BBL CUTS MORTGAGE RATES.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1996-11-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Belgium's Banque Bruxelles</p>
<p>Lambert SA said in a statement on Thursday it would cut its</p>
<p>mortgage interest rates from December 2.</p>
<p>The interest rate charged on standard 10-year fixed rate</p>
<p>mortgages would drop to 6.25 percent from 6.50 percent.</p>
<p>-- Brussels Newsroom +32 2 287 6810, Fax +32 2 230 7710</p>
